      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The concept of non-synaptic diffusion neurotransmission (NDN) is reviewed. Evidence is presented that monoamine neurotransmission is largely by NDN. The role of NDN in pain and sleep is described and its relevance to migraine research is discussed."},
